  "id": "ex-06-nebensatzkonnektoren-a2",
  "intro": "Standalone drill set, not tied to any lesson. A Nebensatzkonnektor (weil, dass, wenn …) sends the finite verb to the END of its clause. weil gives a reason, dass reports a statement/fact, wenn is conditional or repeated-temporal (\"whenever/if\"). If the Nebensatz comes FIRST, the main clause verb jumps right after the comma (subject and verb swap places). Blocks: A Basistraining (word order, then connector choice) → B Vertiefung → C Sprachbausteine → D Wiederholung. Answers in solutions.md.\n",
  "lesson": "EX/06-nebensatzkonnektoren-a2",
  "level": "A2",
  "summary": null,
  "title": "Nebensätze mit weil, dass, wenn — A2",
  "topic": "Nebensatzkonnektoren"
}
